## 十二、巡检模板规范

### 12.1 默认模板

```
系统内置默认模板（可克隆修改）：

"基础巡检 - Cisco IOS"：
  commands: [
    {alias: "show_version", fsm: "show_version",
     commands: {cisco: "show version", huawei: "display version", default: "show version"}},
    {alias: "show_ip_int_brief", fsm: "show_ip_interface_brief",
     commands: {cisco: "show ip interface brief", huawei: "display ip interface brief"}},
    {alias: "show_proc_cpu", fsm: "show_processes_cpu",
     commands: {cisco: "show processes cpu", huawei: "display cpu-usage"}},
    {alias: "show_memory", fsm: "show_memory_statistics",
     commands: {cisco: "show memory statistics", huawei: "display memory"}},
    {alias: "show_logging", fsm: "show_logging",
     commands: {cisco: "show logging | last 10", huawei: "display logbuffer | include ERROR"}},
  ]
  jinja2: "inspection_basic.txt.j2"

"基础巡检 - Huawei VRP"：同上，命令适配华为
```

### 12.2 Jinja2 模板示例

```
templates/jinja2/inspection_basic.txt.j2：

====================================================
          设备巡检报告
====================================================
设备名称: {{ _device.name | default('N/A') }}
IP地址:   {{ _device.ip }}
厂商:     {{ _device.vendor | default('N/A') }}
型号:     {{ _device.model | default('N/A') }}
OS版本:   {{ _device.os_version | default('N/A') }}

----------------------------------------------------
  系统资源
----------------------------------------------------
{% if show_version %}
运行时间: {{ show_version[0].uptime | default('N/A') }}
序列号:   {{ show_version[0].serial | default('N/A') }}
{% endif %}

{% if show_proc_cpu %}
CPU使用率: {{ show_proc_cpu[0].cpu_5_sec | default('N/A') }}%
{% endif %}

{% if show_memory %}
内存使用: {{ show_memory[0].used | default('N/A') }} / {{ show_memory[0].total | default('N/A') }}
{% endif %}

----------------------------------------------------
  接口状态
----------------------------------------------------
{% for intf in show_ip_int_brief | default([]) %}
{{ intf.intf | default('N/A') }}  {{ intf.ipaddr | default('unassigned') }}  {{ intf.status | default('N/A') }}  {{ intf.proto | default('N/A') }}
{% endfor %}

----------------------------------------------------
  最近错误日志
----------------------------------------------------
{% for log in show_logging | default([]) %}
{{ log.timestamp | default('') }} {{ log.severity | default('') }} {{ log.message | default('') }}
{% endfor %}

====================================================
报告生成时间: {{ _meta.generated_at }}
====================================================
```

### 12.3 TextFSM 模板示例

```
templates/textfsm/cisco_ios/show_version.textfsm：

Value Filldown HOSTNAME (\S+)
